{
  "schema": 1,
  "rows": {
    "338:7106": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "4af3c2a994a23f99df0036c59770b303711035e263bdeaf2fe5207781d222623",
      "en": "「No wonder you could force\\nyour way into this universe!」"
    },
    "338:7155": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "023dd496e046f2fc2017ec141ac27473fcaa3fc362680f490bbd928f27e80f16",
      "en": "「You would awaken even now...!」"
    },
    "338:7198": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "99f1c206ee34252df97c1ff8aed0f1a9426c5a7b9df843ca1490b489c10e1f9b",
      "en": "「Do you have the power to make\\nus get serious...!?」"
    },
    "338:7249": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "115790133b2ca5559ec501e1119cf4cc25d2dbed1b04a8d53f16b87436f625d7",
      "en": "「Unbelievable...! What is happening...!?」"
    },
    "338:7292": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "772e4622d472dc2a58f1525b6a061698a0148e14fb069ed2186595825d9bdcfe",
      "en": "「Oh...! That I...\\na $$真徒$$, should be wounded!」"
    },
    "338:7349": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "9e71a270c9887f9c2e0ebd1abcdbe010921dbcd8b8e9f901d049702fe4b4180a",
      "en": "「Impossible...!\\nA $$真徒$$ is supposed to be invincible!」"
    },
    "338:7398": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "b223c97f517ef266bca0fc7e5d5f96ff8054919156e1f3bb946a34d97bf2f75f",
      "en": "「You surpass even the protection of the Exalted Ones!」"
    },
    "338:7439": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "578f82079ae64b2e758f30713427825d8edcff6eb9675e0284cd01e57fc2ccef",
      "en": "「This is the power of Multiverse Release...!?」"
    },
    "338:7468": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "db9ad50de7672d970ff6cb6b4ec55ada8705af8a2ea97b79b440895d63831c4f",
      "en": "「This is their power of possibility...!?」"
    },
    "338:7509": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "769358d0d9188acb6c16b9361ba94722ff43d2d045e77e439976dc332359a2b2",
      "en": "「Impossible...!\\nEven briefly, you attained $$シンカ$$!?」"
    },
    "338:7568": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "7845b42af8e871e5638045a18856764865a7f6a448c992bac675df152768fb54",
      "en": "「The power around that one...! Human feelings!?」"
    },
    "338:5627": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "64f3ffb82cf1a2d2a07bfb0c833fe060f26c9727797f931e607c7fdbcd8b1b3a",
      "en": "「We have already transcended Gundam.」"
    },
    "338:5664": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "f2bb107c1cfb180886496f34877b924aab999c6b7cd499d28acf4aa8a70cdefc",
      "en": "「Even a Gundam is, in the end,\\na product of human civilization.」"
    },
    "338:5715": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "bcd07d2ad4f78d8996feeb5e34bf2a07b17356aa56b3ba3e74083bac819df3f9",
      "en": "「Your psychic waves cannot catch us.」"
    },
    "338:5756": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "436771a3a9a6f49947e2d3d552c6ccdb1bd00b95c4942f88eff5c520ff75e33d",
      "en": "「If you had knelt to the Exalted Ones,\\nyou could have become $$真徒$$s.」"
    },
    "338:5809": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "a4721cb3a7c60c79ea3275607b40d6296ec8186b4f587073ceeb90d492f13b01",
      "en": "「A giant god of steel is nothing but a human idol.」"
    },
    "338:5844": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "1cf416e49f325ac6db87471e988bef1bac7ab11ed0bd3fef2a8a91fb695d5f1c",
      "en": "「Truly a raging giant god.\\nThe word 'pathetic' says it all.」"
    },
    "338:5893": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "330c4af5be8c7f9faf0c3cfea26802d2ff1fc55396d3be64406e3c36e8aebf7f",
      "en": "「Truly nothing but child's play.」"
    },
    "338:5918": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "b68502ce5628bcd6e3f70322df977ede201719908761e9bf5c37b9c01c946642",
      "en": "「You fall short of bearing the sun.」"
    },
    "338:5949": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "dcd29b3361ad2ed0c4967a7508c9f068b6996f992541989bfdae20d07b2b643c",
      "en": "「So you haven't mastered $$ゲッター線$$.」"
    },
    "338:5990": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "42dae9a31054d9c2c0bc8ab15426c96ec2a0606a41c3db8f11cde5f081af6caa",
      "en": "「You seem unable to draw out the power of light.」"
    },
    "338:6023": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "ee78ead16878adcb089b76132cd90440c7466f6b3860426be127d15e1beb47d8",
      "en": "「Thou art guilty.」"
    },
    "338:6040": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "870ffb8ed7e05dd228a4785edc97093bd291d443875d72fe53d4fd9b2c56c268",
      "en": "「Taming a beast is simple.」"
    },
    "338:6073": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "f0733f516ac9cb3ec1f1efba07ccd943e6af7e26d512d02af9a171f032d5ebf5",
      "en": "「Mechanical Angel,\\nwill you not avenge the $$天翅$$s?」"
    },
    "338:6128": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "545ac8749b04be501a9de272ae51653a900e4dee20b1509f74fa7de6ff08129f",
      "en": "「That you've survived until now\\nwas mere luck, it seems.」"
    },
    "338:6185": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "44aee9be8a6af1bc4b4e061cfea83f45adf4029ea8eb308ada02efac42f0f205",
      "en": "「Is this the miracle you speak of?」"
    },
    "338:6214": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "79d00e5419e87b5acb7e48ad902ba82d6b0fc45b0632a708c1e54d16569fbdaa",
      "en": "「There are worlds that effort and\\nguts can never reach.」"
    },
    "338:6263": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "5e1ba24a2c34d0c2b0351419497412d91864d2ebdbea7f3f5164ddf737a6ebce",
      "en": "「Even $$螺旋力$$ reaches its limit here.」"
    },
    "338:6292": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "4663d772d45d700ac15a22987e2acd109188a46a70bddf4b8cb8a202b14ef482",
      "en": "「A fake god gets no further than this.」"
    },
    "338:6327": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "abc55f6857abe2dc83d6f3895d80de38e1c1dedbf8171f0904566540f01135da",
      "en": "「Neither love nor feelings can reach us.」"
    },
    "338:6368": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "03f640d5c0386551c13955ab9d480c53118329ee9764e16c734523b4d341065d",
      "en": "「Disciplined soldiers, degraded into humans.」"
    },
    "338:6411": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "8712afbe90538e181347791ef77eadfef6fdb0904f5aef610546c0072e187a16",
      "en": "「Is that the power of your $$スフィア$$?」"
    },
    "338:6444": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "0dea04a14e28d8ff370fddbbcd58eac5903ad90ebe19ef42223b6e8cf9bf38ce",
      "en": "「After all, $$スフィア$$s are only keys.」"
    },
    "338:6551": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "da68360274fd6ba32cdc19458865753c7949d3cde73f1053d18b5addab5f0cd3",
      "en": "「An attack worthy of the word 'feeble'.」"
    },
    "338:6586": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "f567c147ec7622da23ef46a4d2a57181c5784f91eb5cb61a2e8aa77c8d7cc040",
      "en": "「Why do you think this is enough to fight?」"
    },
    "338:6621": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "4805075bbf416720c35e9565ec76bf199a2837e13ce1240eaaf1d8144aa01a50",
      "en": "「Do you not know the word 'futile'?」"
    },
    "338:6656": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "ec451ce582b2deace0a1a936e9f6bab1a65e6d5a7bc11896969f55415764ed9a",
      "en": "「Are you satisfied with this result?」"
    },
    "338:6681": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "d96c5410584673d7ba0ffc484c8adaa0d1c8fda06d0cbe371eb8da96fbf88036",
      "en": "「A sloppy attack, all momentum.」"
    },
    "338:6706": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "92cfc97977a3bede405178e39f2e6b2ff4306ef2606c5975caf8118c5b12f0a4",
      "en": "「How powerless. It is almost sad.」"
    },
    "338:6733": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "b3c475f65c2b39352483d95053d9e6c639fb7d5b640166211a75166f2f6d69f8",
      "en": "「So this is what you call an attack.」"
    },
    "338:6760": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "7f9328ead1e198233ae72e04e5f77e1d00e4bc1121827b42b611d2654c4a74d9",
      "en": "「Do you not intend to reflect on your actions?」"
    },
    "338:6799": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "25f0fe01b3fc912550e9d3226d250d92252e8c57e836a6d22bc6e5fd8e143812",
      "en": "「I will give you credit for landing that hit.」"
    },
    "338:6826": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "8b14fa31801a6a063b60484926d83a245aa1a769751a88362c889254666309ba",
      "en": "「Your heart must be about to break.」"
    },
    "338:6857": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "dc5b6eb60dcbbebe29dc5afc4e1abeb2f47d04faf95f37905f91991fe9a938fc",
      "en": "「Even now, you won't give up?」"
    },
    "338:6890": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "10d910860605f790643cf2c3fdf1c791bdecfa47360ffef578380113d544447d",
      "en": "「Seeing this result, you'll still fight?」"
    },
    "338:5359": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "b4c3c6f770b3d43ce81a5bb2112bbd9f661a4e9985bb465bfc289f786608f918",
      "en": "「That was a good chance to know your place.」"
    },
    "338:5394": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "0c4487434c5541848aebfb4db2b225c8a6e9766628e4b948e402b04fb4a3ec7a",
      "en": "「It is all in the palm of my hand.」"
    },
    "338:5425": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "d093e3f61caf4827bd3843f5971bf77d43a4370feccc458a4b54da58725381a3",
      "en": "「Struggle, then. Until your strength fails.」"
    },
    "338:5456": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "850a108a731838c21b0eb47d3786526a7d8b7b4e8c3e2dce586db70a6a699ad7",
      "en": "「I haven't moved a single step.」"
    },
    "338:5485": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "641b461eff6e600bddcdc9f65b2bd9007fd92cc1caf9b4c8032a49b570962378",
      "en": "「I merely warped the surrounding dimension.」"
    },
    "338:5514": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "6aa485e032261d1847dfcd74bb50290c6181def44847c45e935d93226585a13a",
      "en": "「I can read your moves ten steps ahead.」"
    },
    "338:5553": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "ab61211d273b97ad069180ac6a1cb76743934e644980be3bbc542a32febc76fc",
      "en": "「Do you see now? Resisting is futile.」"
    },
    "338:5596": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "d2211d043f72ede03b51c57e5c33c812f07780d6c674e914f636c05b13734376",
      "en": "「A hostile will... How unsightly.」"
    },
    "338:6483": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "ed4ffcdbdf067a5c721a810ad420aea9d3c38ee7b76b73f435abcfb3e58f32cd",
      "en": "「Why did you think that would work?」"
    },
    "338:6518": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "e419d328febcd7324794e7960b9b6165a7ba4ff9c3d9d00b08d7d562e8d48a7b",
      "en": "「This too is the protection of the Exalted Ones.」"
    },
    "338:4628": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "161c355ac9deee8d2e399cec8e7c4860d0ed8064cc09967c3421984ab27dffa0",
      "en": "「I have the protection of God!」"
    },
    "338:4655": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "095fab71d17ceb4a690b43f72cee9dd5718ec604dcd677567d27d932d542981b",
      "en": "「Protecting my comrades is also my duty!」"
    },
    "338:4686": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "2b2d79ece32b3f357ae0174bb7dee4254e710bf92fb6f922b6dc5cebdc913f51",
      "en": "「My iron will shall be the shield!」"
    },
    "338:4717": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "303767b148159e92cf5294f13612918a9bdf730abbb30c40c059bec708bc5bf0",
      "en": "「This body... I have already offered to you.」"
    },
    "338:4758": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "88ed8f03b77a37ab16723b4eafca24535311d496ca6ec2df70541f8baeb4d3ba",
      "en": "「This is my deepest wish! My happiness!」"
    },
    "338:5103": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "8611fc1a26e912364ba2b25d146a57c9ecb87c22a931090152decadeebc53c9e",
      "en": "「What!? Unable to counterattack!?」"
    },
    "338:5132": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "79f134b3171e57f4c83f83c7dc687e82b5a3d5116b4428b4b2d01542135eb835",
      "en": "「Tch!\\nOutwitted by a mere Earthling!」"
    },
    "338:5181": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "c1455358382177d60db1d02846a4dd832121a22c06c905703d33e01599707808",
      "en": "「I... was outwitted...!?」"
    },
    "338:5214": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "6c41f3705573314f0e786e55c9675598667c1dc8aee172828a27426f7f619ac4",
      "en": "「How humiliating...! I'm helpless...!」"
    },
    "338:5255": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "ccd6e9b53b904bdc936023bea1bf55c7c0e937d50700fe50bea734fe270e0872",
      "en": "「...Very well.\\nI'll repay this rage double.」"
    },
    "338:5306": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "a15cb165271f7276eb79305cc07c5a89d63f6be750f27ee34e7c10be73ac029d",
      "en": "「That one's tactics\\nhave outdone me, a $$真徒$$...!」"
    },
    "338:778": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "6d4c1f0c29368562ca367b94fe812ffd86936316c4664b82495931ef013d85e5",
      "en": "「Begone!」"
    },
    "338:797": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "121981ef0267f9ca21077ae95cc38e2cfcf7f01b8b7874c84b797debd7d35c72",
      "en": "「This is judgment!」"
    },
    "338:816": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "d1b91b8db7c7cf71cba9cade20d27b86420f9f7f03d2ef2ebac6b37e2797ce78",
      "en": "「Fear! And worship!」"
    },
    "338:845": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "1a4ceef8daf90582f40a49f21f27858e69d3d2eb2f45291b4c7a6b1560f94811",
      "en": "「I carry out the sentence!」"
    },
    "338:864": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "401f383e5cc2d513ae15afeb923626102e099a3e5347836867c63124acb7672f",
      "en": "「Return to nothingness!」"
    },
    "338:887": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "877301f22023447df704bbd990c11eb5846f329f841971d2800d4ea6ade51d6f",
      "en": "「Vanish into the causal horizon!」"
    },
    "338:912": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "309bf79cf6404ff119debda130de1c26069692217a1551d4f55b7c56b18ed51d",
      "en": "「I deliver punishment!」"
    },
    "338:929": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "fff7abfc73639a83bacbf59682be36590fa0b61964eef3b1239770bf3a150055",
      "en": "「Turn to atomic dust!」"
    },
    "338:950": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "4c256d49c31c09cca47c4fa3e450453c2e5f247f5445deec5cf3ed71078e0da2",
      "en": "「The power is mine!」"
    },
    "338:969": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "c92eddffc47ebf64b7417d919c0777e53b36d0a571cd5d76d74230b32cdaea50",
      "en": "「To what lies beyond, we go!」"
    },
    "338:994": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "42b036c345b1e47f4bd1942117e67b9e429e6d13d9536fec1799ebe7487f07a6",
      "en": "「This is the power of the chosen!」"
    },
    "338:1023": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "02e17bf9e75d891ebe44f0f18b2b87f6c25c80549ef4c7c03237d98d93e6f71c",
      "en": "「I shall guide you all!」"
    },
    "338:1050": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "2cf79f3b5ea4328a50547d1d1c19aea08fa5b57d6eb2344663e077f91672c4dc",
      "en": "「We are the light!」"
    },
    "338:1071": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "66f697cd6ec823e13c287fd2d41184e785059cf42e288c0ab17e2dde8eea8a5a",
      "en": "「Perish, along with your malice!」"
    }
  },
  "speakers": {
    "g338": {
      "token": "$$真徒$$",
      "basis": "Calls himself a True Disciple, speaks of the Exalted Ones' protection, scorns Z-BLUE's Gundams/Getter/Spheres; Jigoku's Space Demon King does not fit"
    }
  },
  "report": {
    "uncertain": [
      "speaker is a True Disciple (token $$真徒$$), not Space Demon King; likely a generic or unnamed disciple voice",
